 "Node name for S&R": "easy downloadIndexTTSAndLoadModel"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "slot_index": 0, "links": [6], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [250, 136], "pos": [93.83393096923828, 513.5097045898438], "widgets_values": ["bcbca2b48a9ec581486a9bdbc6838afbc9321843b6d9936ca93c8393c7bd8e4a.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 31, "type": "LoadAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [2], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [250, 100], "pos": [110.03507995605469, 32.58732604980469], "widgets_values": ["[s1] 观众朋友们，大家好！今天咱俩聊个轻松的话题 —— 旅行！\n[s2] 太好了，这旅行谁不爱啊，游山玩水，放松心情。\n[s1] 就是啊！别人旅行是看风景，我旅行是 “演喜剧”，走到哪儿，哪儿就有我的糗事。\n[s2] 哦？还有这事儿？您给说道说道。\n[s1] 就说上次，我报了个团去爬山，导游千叮咛万嘱咐，说山上温差大，让多带件外套。\n[s2] 这是好心提醒，没错啊。\n[s1] 我呢，嫌麻烦，心说 “我年轻力壮，火力旺，冻不着”，就背了个空包，揣了瓶水就上山了。\n[s2] 胆子够大的。\n[s1] 刚爬一半，坏了！天阴了，刮大风，那风一吹，跟小刀子似的，我冻得直打哆嗦，嘴唇都紫了。\n[s2] 让你不听劝！\n[s1] 旁边有个大爷，看我可怜，从包里掏出件衣服递给我。\n[s2] 还是好人多啊。\n[s1] 我感动得热泪盈眶，接过来穿上，嘿，正合身！就是这衣服吧，有点花哨，上面还印着俩大字 ——老年！\n[s2] 嗨！人大爷穿的是老年旅游团的统一服装吧！\n[s1] 可不是嘛！我穿着那件老年衫，在山上走了仨小时，一路上别人都冲我点头：“大爷，您身体真棒！” 我都不好意思说我才三十出头！\n[s2] 这叫自作自受！那后来呢？\n[s1] 后来下山，我把衣服还给大爷，大爷还夸我：“小伙子，不错啊，穿我们老年衫还挺精神！” 我当时真想找个地缝钻进去！\n[s2] 乐死我了！还有别的糗事吗？\n[s1] 还有一次去海边，我寻思着体验一把 “面朝大海，春暖花开”，特意穿了条新买的沙滩裤。\n[s2] 挺应景的。\n[s1] 结果到了海边，一个浪头打过来，直接给我裤子冲跑了！\n[s2] 啊？这么刺激！\n[s1] 我当时都懵了，赶紧捂着屁股往岸上跑，一边跑一边喊：“我的裤子！我的裤子！” 旁边还有人拍照，嘴里还念叨：“看，这小伙子玩得真投入！”\n[s2] 得，这下成海边一景了！\n[s1] 最可气的是我朋友，不光不帮我，还在旁边笑，说：“你这趟没白来，回头照片发朋友圈，绝对爆款！”\n[s2] 损友啊这是！\n[s1] 所以说啊，旅行这事儿，看着美，实则处处是 “惊喜”！不过话说回来，甭管多糗，等回头一想，哎，全是乐子！\n[s2] 那倒是！旅行的意义，不就是看不一样的风景，遇不一样的事儿嘛！\n[s1] 没错！希望大伙儿下次旅行，都能顺顺利利，就算遇点小囧事，也能当个乐子记着！\n[s2] 说得好！感谢各位！\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "slot_index": 0, "links": [0, 1], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"name": "subtitle", "label": "subtitle", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "subtitle"}], "size": [250, 220], "pos": [727.1829833984375, 62.063209533691406], "widgets_values": ["false", 4242950409, 842430791, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "indextts_model", "link": 3, "label": "indextts_model", "type": "EASY_INDEXTTS_MODEL", "localized_name": "indextts_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "reference_audio", "label": "reference_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "reference_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "reference_audios", "link": 4, "label": "reference_audios", "type": "AUDIOS", "localized_name": "reference_audios"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "emotions", "label": "emotions", "type": "EASY_INDEXTTS_EMOTIONS", "localized_name": "emotions"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 2, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "unload_model"}, "name": "unload_model", "label": "unload_model", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "unload_model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "easy indexTTSGenerateSimple", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy indexTTSGenerateSimple"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVers